  "content": "<p>如需该模组的数据包版本，请前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p>为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>的砧板添加了更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a>的切割配方</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有木材类型的剥皮、去树皮和回收功能</li>\n<li>从以下物品获得更多染料：\n<ul>\n<li>可制作成1种染料的鲜花</li>\n<li>蓝莓</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Wood Cutting\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Flower Cutting\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomeswevegone/media/blueberrycutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Blueberry Cutting\"></p>\n<p>想要将所有农夫切割内容整合为一个模组吗？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫切割合集</a>！</p>",
